---
layout: base.njk
title: Privacy Policy | Ridgeway Rentals
description: Read the Ridgeway Rentals privacy policy to learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you request or book a trailer rental.
---
<section class="section section-full section-hero-header interior" data-reveal-group>
  <div class="container-interior" data-reveal>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: {% year %}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-full" data-reveal-group>
  <div class="container-interior legal-content" data-reveal>

    <p>
      Ridgeway Rentals ("we", "us", or "our") respects your privacy and is committed to
      protecting the personal information you share with us when you request a quote,
      book a trailer, or otherwise contact us through {{ site.url }}.
    </p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      When you submit a booking request or contact form, we may collect your name, email
      address, phone number, delivery address, and details about your rental request
      (such as drop-off/pick-up dates and what you plan to dispose of).
    </p>

    <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>
      We use the information you provide to confirm trailer availability, schedule
      delivery and pickup, respond to your inquiries, and communicate with you about your
      booking. We do not sell your personal information to third parties.
    </p>

    <h2>Sharing Your Information</h2>
    <p>
      We may share your information with staff or contractors involved in fulfilling your
      rental, or when required to comply with the law. We do not share your information
      with third parties for their own marketing purposes.
    </p>

    <h2>Data Retention</h2>
    <p>
      We retain booking and contact information only as long as necessary to fulfill your
      request, maintain business records, and comply with legal obligations.
    </p>

    <h2>Your Rights</h2>
    <p>
      You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information
      at any time by contacting us using the details below.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at
      <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> or
      <a href="tel:{{ site.phone | replace('-', '') }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>
